/target
**/*.rs.bk

# Recorder output. Every `capture_*` example writes one PNG per frame into `frames-<name>/`; the GIFs
# in `docs/` are the committed artefact and the frames are the intermediate. `capture_carnage` alone
# writes 382 of them.
/frames-*

# Serena's per-project cache. A tool's index of this repo, not part of it.
/.serena
